  "jcr:description": "GraftJacket NOW is a ready-to-use, acellular human dermal matrix that provides strength and support with demonstrated vessel infiltration – a key indicator for graft incorporation.<sup>1</sup> With its strong and flexible design and beneficial biological characteristics, it serves as a strong addition to strengthen primary repairs short and long term, eliminating the morbidity associated with harvesting allograft.",
